<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0615_T27PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill: Ayo! I’m Bill. THE Bill. And\nyou?\rHmm, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, huh? Never heard of\nyou.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0615_T27PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know what? I’m the one who built\nthe homie transfer\fsystem. Genius. Self-made.\rWell. Not REAL self-made.\rThis girl Lanette from Hoenn made the\nStorage System easier to use.\rSo she did the work and I got famous.\nThat’s how tech work.\rI gotta hurry back to Goldenrod.\fMy mama said be home by dinner.\fBuh-bye!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0615_T27PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Dancers is SO pretty.\rThe way they dance and use their\nhomies... I’m in love. With all five.\fIt’s complicated.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0615_T27PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty, the Block Boss, is SOOO fine.\rHis homies tough too. He told me he\nsee ghosts. I didn’t ask.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0615_T27PC0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lake of Rage... A RED GYARADOS...\fIt’s a CONSPIRACY. I KNOW it!\rThe government dyin’ the fish!\fWAKE UP, PEOPLE!</language>
	</row>
</body>
